{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_07",
  "title": "健康零食",
  "storyCode": "DT-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8d61bb1a585bb09a57747026e526012580f8773b603614d1c66c1c040c96b5fa",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g26_dusk_wild"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打、打完了？都解決掉了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈……哈……累死我了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈！不錯啊小丫頭，你那幾招真有點意思，老子果然最喜歡術師了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀呀……還好大家沒打起來，人都沒事就好，人都沒事就好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，老子今天心情好！帶你們去吃老子自己種的玉米！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大哥，你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？……玉米？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "剛還在哈哈大笑的拓荒者一下子爬了起來，舉起武器，對準小隊四人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……呼……看來他這是回神了，我剛才真的以為他要跟我們握手和好呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪露希爾也抬起法杖，頭髮隨著魔法微微地蕩漾起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？欸？幾位這又是怎麼回事？怎麼又要打起來了？剛還同生共死呢，你們不是和好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……哼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克&先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪露希爾，你先別施展魔法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不然這樣吧，大家剛處理完這些東西，都很累了，再打下去沒什麼好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們數三聲，都放下武器，各自退回原來的地方，保證今晚互不打擾，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳咳咳！！怎……麼……樣……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看這位大哥多有誠意啊，都這樣了還在堅持！幾位看呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大哥，我們的人也累慘了，再打下去沒好處啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好，數三聲，今晚互不打擾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀！真好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三、二、一！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真好……晚上可以睡個安穩覺了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Zzz……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪露希爾？瑪露希爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Zzz……嗯？……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！發、發生什麼事了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，瑪露希爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們想去看看剛才那些魔物的構造，順便……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫覺得那些東西很像螃蟹，吃起來或許就是寶箱怪的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊，寶箱怪很有嚼勁的，而且越嚼越好吃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你們別再用我的開鎖工具去挖肉吃就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是那個真的很好用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "《鮑勃的美食指南》上寫了這種東西是可以吃的，味道很鮮美，就是破開外殼有點麻煩！你不想吃看看嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不想！而且被誤會成是返回戰場準備偷襲的話，說不定還要再打一場！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那些滿天亂飛的魔法器具很煩，那邊現在還有不少！我也很累——\n欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吧唧吧唧吧唧……欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吧唧……欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者&萊歐斯小隊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拓荒者們正往嘴裡塞鉗獸腳的手僵硬地停住了。\n漫長的靜止裡只有篝火燃燒的聲音。\n噼——啪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來牠的鉗子裡長著這麼多肉，難怪能夠支撐起沉重的外殼，還能鉗碎那些魔法器具……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是從腹部下刀殺死的，也掀開了後蓋，原來如此，看來處理牠的方式和處理寶箱怪相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且……嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好香！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……試試？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……咕~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萊歐斯伸手接過了烤好的肉，猶豫了一下，塞進嘴裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯~！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好吃喔！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈！老子的手藝……咳！呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你也吃看看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯……？真的很有嚼勁！很香欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，給你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？我也有？謝了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烤得恰到好處，沒有損失水分，真的和寶箱怪的味道很像！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，吃就完事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吃完嘴巴閉緊，老子還是要外面的名聲的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今晚的事誰都別說出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者&萊歐斯小隊&瑞恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（為什麼你們白天打得你死我活的，現在卻坐在這裡一起吃烤肉啊？！我根本就沒必要趕過來啊……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是半夜上廁所路過，什麼都沒看到啊哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*俚語*算了……過來吧！你送藥給我們，老子心裡記著的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這件事就，就這樣算了吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不行，不能這樣算了！老子的糧倉啊！你們為什麼要炸老子的糧倉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "才沒有！是你們的魔法器具先攻擊我們，我們為了自衛才被迫反擊的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魔、魔法器具？你叫無人機這個？它們都瘋了，哪還聽我的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸……可是你們還從村子裡面跑出來攻擊我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒者A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們要來搶我們的物資啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有這種事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_090",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "停停停，我算是聽懂了！這就是一場誤會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑞恩",
